#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-striver-mini-vtol.rst:11
#: 6f488c1370f34fc7ae636aa9e7bea5de
msgid ""
"Striver mini VTOL is a 7 kg class vertical take-off and landing UAV, which "
"continues the classic aerodynamic layout, high reliability avionics system "
"and modular design of the MakeFlyEasy Fighter VTOL."
msgstr ""
"Striver mini VTOL 是一款 7kg 级垂直起降无人机，延续了 MakeFlyEasy Fighter VTOL "
"经典的气动布局、高可靠性航电系统和模块化设计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-striver-mini-vtol.rst:13
#: 437bf20d5ab342bfa32f044b56c71c1f
